  "semantic_findings": [
    "Provider EN/ZH retain one checkout-owned explicit tests/contracts CMake project, canonical schema-2 inputs, MCU-only selection, rejection rules and source snapshot responsibility. The three-fixture example is explicitly narrower than the existing 26+3=29-fixture H743 stage; no second graph or automatic family/project discovery is introduced.",
    "All five new provider Chinese message pairs preserve the English normative strength, paths, counts, failure conditions and development-only evidence boundary. The two superseded English message/Chinese translation pairs remain obsolete without rewriting their values.",
    "Capability EN/ZH introduce only the three canonical path-list replacements. Both languages keep code paths verbatim. All previous active and obsolete msgpair values are retained; the superseded path lists stay obsolete as historical bytes.",
    "H743 README English and Chinese agree on STM32H743ZIT6, baremetal, fixed HSI64/default factory trim, Cache off, DEV_ID 0x450, V REV_ID 0x2003, SPI4 mode 0, 8-bit finite full-duplex SPI, initialized non-overlapping AXI spans of 1..65535 bytes, route/IRQ/DMA identity and optional UART TX or RX coexistence. Neither language grants continuous UART duplex, Cache-on, high clocks, other backends, 16-bit, fixed dummy or multisegment scope.",
    "The public factory/face wording preserves static existing typed interfaces, one public C11 smoke source reused by the existing H743 CMake project and three independent selected installed-SDK consumer roots. Private constructors/MMIO/vendor types are not promoted to public API. DMA completion and failed withdrawal retain borrow/drain and recovery responsibility.",
    "The immutable required SDK plan is 34 roots / 37 images: 3 base roots, 10 MCU/backend roots, 21 selected roots; four Native images must execute and 33 ARM images link. Generic retention covers 10+19=29 ARM images, separate from base resource checks. These are plan scopes, not proof of a new successful run.",
    "Source inspection confirms strict integer schema 2 in the explicit-project/selected-consumer and transport guards, consumer policy v3 and exact selection admission. The README keeps historical policy-v2 31/34 and schema-1 evidence tied to its original source/bytes/helper, with no fallback or requalification.",
    "Only IO-27 implementation_status moves pending to in_progress. The 42-row ledger remains 18 implemented / 15 in_progress / 9 pending; every software_status remains not_qualified and every hardware_status remains not_executed.",
    "The actual Doxygen/gettext/merge receipt and original raw byte identities were read and checked. Fresh extraction targets two pages and emits five POTs including ancestors; this supplies message/source binding only. It does not establish HTML/site admission, fresh software-candidate, SDK, ARM, reproducibility, electrical or physical HIL qualification."
  ],
